  "text": "A: Hey, did you hear about the new caf\u00e9 that opened downtown?\n\nB: No, really? What's it called?\n\nA: *The Roasted Bean.* I think they have a really cool vibe.\n\nB: Oh, I've heard the name before. Is it worth the drive?\n\nA: Definitely. The coffee is amazing, and they have these pastries that are out of this world.\n\nB: Cool, I'll have to check it out. How long have they been open?\n\nA: Just a few weeks. The owner used to work at a fancy caf\u00e9 in the city.\n\nB: That's interesting. Does he have a good reputation?\n\nA: From what I heard, he's pretty passionate about quality. They even source their beans locally.\n\nB: That\u2019s great. I like when places care about where their ingredients come from.\n\nA: Yeah, it\u2019s a nice change from the usual chain places. It feels more authentic.\n\nB: I agree. I\u2019d rather support local businesses than big corporations, you know?\n\nA: Exactly. Plus, the atmosphere is way better. It's like a cozy little spot.\n\nB: Yeah, I can imagine. I\u2019d probably bring my book and just relax there.\n\nA: That sounds perfect. Maybe I'll go with you sometime.\n\nB: Sure, I\u2019d love that. Let me know when you're free.\n\nA: I will. I\u2019ll text you the address so you don't get lost.\n\nB: Thanks. I\u2019ll be there.",
